érif, requests Malik to accept a dangerous heist in exchange for Serge and her client's liberty. Malik must convince and reunite Chérif's former partners to accomplish this high-risk stickup."},{"language":"fr-FR","title":"Tigres et Hyènes","overview":"De retour d’Espagne, Malik, jeune trafiquant, apprend que Serge, son beau-père, a été arrêté. Lors du procès, Iris, avocate de Chérif, un complice présumé, propose à Malik de réaliser un mystérieux coup pour faire évader son beau-père. Malik accepte et fait équipe avec les anciens partenaires de Chérif, des malfrats rangés, prêts à se réunir une dernière fois."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4HEOqC1r2T2Zl1RAAD6ZnZKgXQm.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4HEOqC1r2T2Zl1RAAD6ZnZKgXQm.png","language":"it","width":1986,"height":668},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3CMLqLOUIgnYKYGaJA4OmWVOEyb.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3CMLqLOUIgnYKYGaJA4OmWVOEyb.png","language":"fr","width":2450,"height":556},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s9IfeWf3ha84jfLN24dY2qnwv65.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/s9IfeWf3ha84jfLN24dY2qnwv65.png","language":"fr","width":739,"height":515}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cRy6P31Mwx1t12tXTMTeUX4Kugi.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cRy6P31Mwx1t12tXTMTeUX4Kugi.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vb6qzT0egUPHcmUwusPNl9j943p.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vb6qzT0egUPHcmUwusPNl9j943p.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wyGaJk25KqJOFwJWV5bzf8PWP9J.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wyGaJk25KqJOFwJWV5bzf8PWP9J.jpg","language":"fr","width":1080,"height":1600},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/80Fp